- Update to version 0.2.47 (git f9c8a112)
  * Add symbol conversion (disabled by default) with a Mozc-derived
    supplemental symbol dictionary; promote symbol candidates in
    normal conversion while preserving leading candidates, live
    conversion and typo corrections.
