Sun Nov 15 04:30:00 UTC 2026 - presire <presire@users.noreply.github.com>

- Initial package of hazkey-community 0.2.46 (git ae10749a)
  * Swift server built offline from the SwiftPM vendor tarball
    with swift-lang 6.4.1 from devel:tools:compiler
  * Swift runtime bundled privately (swift-lang has no static stdlib)
  * Subpackages: fcitx5-hazkey-community, ibus-hazkey-community,
    hazkey-community-selinux (SUSE %selinux_* scriptlets, .pp.bz2)
  * Ship license/notice files of the bundled Swift runtime
  * Include the complete ICU 76.1 license and third-party notices for
    double-conversion and dictionary data embedded in lib_FoundationICU
